<p>
  {dgettext(
    "help_channels",
    "Grants channel owner status to a user (prefix ~). Owners have the highest privilege level and can set any mode, including +o and +q. The first user to join an unregistered channel is automatically made owner."
  )}
</p>
<.help_h4 icon={:icon_role_owner}>{dgettext("help_channels", "Hierarchy")}</.help_h4>
<p>
  {dgettext("help_channels", "Owner (~) > Operator (@) > Half-Operator (%) > Voice (+) > Regular")}
</p>
<p>
  {dgettext(
    "help_channels",
    "Each member holds one rank at a time. Half-operators and above can kick, and operators and above can ban. Both only work on members of a lower rank."
  )}
</p>
<.help_h4 icon={:icon_lightbulb}>{dgettext("help_channels", "When to use it")}</.help_h4>
<p>
  {dgettext(
    "help_channels",
    "Add a second owner when you run a channel together with someone, so both of you have full control. A channel can have more than one owner at the same time. To hand the channel over and step down yourself, use a transfer instead."
  )}
</p>
<.help_h4 icon={:icon_terminal}>{dgettext("help_channels", "Usage")}</.help_h4>
<pre>/mode +q Alice  {dgettext("help_channels", "Make Alice an owner")}
/mode -q Alice  {dgettext("help_channels", "Remove owner from Alice")}
/transfer Alice  {dgettext("help_channels", "Make Alice the owner and become an operator")}</pre>
<p>{dgettext("help_channels", "Only other owners can grant or revoke +q.")}</p>
<.help_h4 icon={:icon_rules}>{dgettext("help_channels", "Rules and limits")}</.help_h4>
<ul>
  <li>
    {dgettext(
      "help_channels",
      "The person must be in the channel. The command changes the channel you are looking at."
    )}
  </li>
  <li>
    {dgettext(
      "help_channels",
      "Owner status given with this command is not kept when the person leaves the channel."
    )}
  </li>
  <li>
    {dgettext(
      "help_channels",
      "In a registered channel, the founder and the people on the ChanServ %{level} list become owners each time they join.",
      level: "SOP"
    )}
  </li>
  <li>
    {dgettext(
      "help_channels",
      "In an unregistered channel, the owner rank goes to whoever joins the empty channel first. Register the channel with ChanServ to keep it."
    )}
  </li>
</ul>
<.help_h4 icon={:icon_link}>{dgettext("help_channels", "See Also")}</.help_h4>
<p>
  <.help_link topic="mode-o">{dgettext("help_channels", "Operator (+o)")}</.help_link>
  · <.help_link topic="mode-h">{dgettext("help_channels", "Half-Operator (+h)")}</.help_link>
  · <.help_link topic="cmd-transfer">{dgettext("help_channels", "/transfer")}</.help_link>
  ·
  <.help_link topic="chanserv-register">
    {dgettext("help_channels", "Registering a Channel")}
  </.help_link>
  · <.help_link topic="chanserv-access">{dgettext("help_channels", "Access Lists")}</.help_link>
</p>
